delivery_ref: docs/supreme/specs/2026-09-15-echo-agent-sdk-independent-repository/plans/delivery-map.md#framework-migration-baseline
todos:
  - id: isolate-current-framework-state
    summary: 建立专用 echo-agent 任务 worktree，并把当前工作树的 tracked 修改无损投影到该分支，不接触用户原工作树。
    files:
      - echo-agent/
      - echo-agent-worktrees/echo-agent-sdk-migration-baseline/
    acceptance:
      - 隔离分支以当前 HEAD 为基线，tracked diff 与源工作树逐文件一致，源工作树 status 前后不变。
  - id: close-baseline-consistency
    summary: 核对并闭合当前 framework 与 SDK 重叠改动的编译、生成合同和语言投影一致性，只修复迁移基线无法验证的问题。
    files:
      - echo-agent-worktrees/echo-agent-sdk-migration-baseline/echo-integration/
      - echo-agent-worktrees/echo-agent-sdk-migration-baseline/echo-orchestration/
      - echo-agent-worktrees/echo-agent-sdk-migration-baseline/echo-sdk-host/
      - echo-agent-worktrees/echo-agent-sdk-migration-baseline/echo-sdk-protocol/
      - echo-agent-worktrees/echo-agent-sdk-migration-baseline/contracts/sdk/
      - echo-agent-worktrees/echo-agent-sdk-migration-baseline/sdks/
    acceptance:
      - 生成物由唯一入口刷新且 framework、Host、protocol、shared catalog 与三语言 API 没有未解释漂移。
  - id: verify-framework-migration-baseline
    summary: 按 echo-agent 当前规则完成 Rust workspace、feature topology、SDK contract、真实
      Host 进程和三语言源码的适用完整门禁。
    files:
      - echo-agent-worktrees/echo-agent-sdk-migration-baseline/Cargo.toml
      - echo-agent-worktrees/echo-agent-sdk-migration-baseline/Cargo.lock
      - echo-agent-worktrees/echo-agent-sdk-migration-baseline/scripts/
      - echo-agent-worktrees/echo-agent-sdk-migration-baseline/.github/workflows/
    acceptance:
      - 所有适用 formatter、clippy、test、no-default/feature matrix、contract 和 language
        SDK 命令在最后一次相关修改后零失败。
  - id: deliver-baseline-branch
    summary: 提交并推送精确迁移基线，记录本地、远端 SHA 与源工作树保持状态。
    files:
      - echo-agent-worktrees/echo-agent-sdk-migration-baseline/
    acceptance:
      - 任务分支 commit 已关闭 GPG 签名并推送；git ls-remote 返回同一完整 SHA，用户原工作树仍保持初始分支和修改集合。
